# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES EXAMPLE
# Manish Vidhya Narayanan | AI & Data Science Portfolio

# ==================================================
# SITE CONFIGURATION
# ==================================================

# Your production website URL (no trailing slash)
# This is used for:
# - SEO metadata (canonical URLs, Open Graph)
# - Sitemap generation
# - Structured data (JSON-LD)

# Current Production URL (Vercel):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://manish-ai-data-science-portfolio-rho.vercel.app

# ==================================================
# NOTES
# ==================================================

# 1. Create a .env.local file for local development (not committed to git)
# 2. For production deployment on Vercel:
#    - Set environment variables in the Vercel dashboard
#    - They will be automatically injected during build
# 3. Variables prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_ are exposed to the browser
# 4. Never commit sensitive API keys or secrets to git
# 5. The .env.local file is already in .gitignore

# ==================================================
# CUSTOM DOMAIN (FUTURE)
# ==================================================

# When you acquire a custom domain (e.g., manishvidhya.com):
# 1. Configure DNS in Vercel Dashboard
# 2. Update this variable to: https://yourdomain.com
# 3. Update in Vercel environment variables
# 4. Redeploy the application

# ==================================================
# ANALYTICS (OPTIONAL)
# ==================================================

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (optional)
# To enable analytics:
# 1. Create a Google Analytics 4 property at https://analytics.google.com
# 2. Add your website URL: https://manish-ai-data-science-portfolio-rho.vercel.app
# 3. Copy the Measurement ID (format: G-XXXXXXXXXX)
# 4. Set this variable in Vercel Dashboard or .env.local
# 5. Analytics will automatically activate

# Example Measurement ID (replace with your real ID):
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# IMPORTANT:
# - This is a PLACEHOLDER - replace with your real Google Analytics ID
# - Analytics is completely optional for portfolio functionality
# - The site works perfectly without analytics
# - Never commit real measurement IDs to public repositories

# ==================================================
# FUTURE VARIABLES (when needed)
# ==================================================

# For future backend integration:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com

# For form submissions (when implemented):
# FORM_SUBMISSION_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.example.com/submit
